Z||000021||SpeedPhreak||01-25-2000||06:14 PM||||as a mobile dj my cd collection is HUGE (although its not all mine), 40's big band through last months biggest releases across the board.<P>as a house party dj my vinyl collection is mostly hard trance, hard house, hardcore, some jungle, some ambient, some breakbeat, & some "battle records" (dj rectangle).  although its not my favorite...i have a collection of hip-hop & rap & r&B.  i also have some classical & native american tribal music & the jungle book on record.  i also have some disco...one of my favorite mixes is to play the original "stayin alive"  then drop a deep techno beat behind it...EVERYONE from old people (no offense) to my highschool brother & his friends love it.<P>when im not spinning, give me the above mentioned punk, listed djs (plus paul okenfold, paul vandyk, & various others), 80's rock & new wave stuff (u spin me right round is 1 of my all time favorites) & yes i do like a country song or 3.  i have lots of friends who listen to only rap/hiphop/r&b so i dont listen to that on my own time cause i get (more than) my fill with them.  i love music that most people hate (some bigger bands that u may know...white zombie, nofx, pennywise, & marylin manson)...basically anything that is faster than 105 beats per minute.<P>||||reg||6
