Z||000029||batboy||02-03-2000||05:40 PM||||Finally! The last 4 posts I understand and can relate to. Some of the previous posts had me believing you guys were talking in some weird foreign language...LOL.<P>Pink Floyd! My all time favorite band. I bought my first Floyd album (Meddle) in 1973. I wore out two Dark Side of the Moon albums. I have all their albums and CDs except for a couple of the very early Tower label album releases. I have Animals in pink vinyl, Dark Side of the Moon on white vinyl, Division Bell in blue and a French copy of Momentary Lapse of Reason in white. I also have about a half dozen live bootleg albums and CDs, plus a couple VCR tapes (The Wall movie and the Pulse concert video (awesome light show). Pink Floyd rules!<p>[This message has been edited by batboy (edited 02-03-2000).]||||reg||1
