Z||000034||RossT||02-03-2000||11:52 PM||||Batboy, I am very jealous of your vinyl floyd collection. I do have a mobile fidelity<BR>master recording vinyl of Dark Side. I also have a Japan version of Dark Side (Japanees lettering) boot leg on CD that was imported before it was officially released on CD back in 83. <P>2m4, I also like Gilmore over Rogers but to each is own i guess. I subsribe to a pink floyd reminder e-mail service and there is talk that Gilmore and Rogers have patched things up, and something might be in the works together after Waters tour of the US this summer.  There is more to this than just rumor!!! <P>Most true floyd fans do not like Momentary lapse.... but I think that it is my favorite.<P>1. Momentary Lapse..<BR>2. Dark Side<BR>3. The Wall<BR>4. Animals<BR>5. Division Bell<P>Those are my top 5.<P>Hope to see Waters this Summer...<P>2m4..  Animals live in 77!!!!  (you da man)!!||||reg||1
