Z||000039||Raydar||02-13-2000||05:07 PM||||Wow... I've missed a lot of stuff, here.<BR>Batboy and Ross (and other Floyd fans), have you ever seen the video "Pink Floyd Live At Pompeii"? It is, for the most part, a live performance of Meddle (sort of), in an empty arena. There are some other things there, too. They are in the process of recording Dark Side..., and are still experimenting with guitar licks, etc. <BR>That's great news about a possible Gilmore/Waters "meeting of the minds". If it comes to pass, it gonna be a hell of an event.<BR>BTW... doesn't Gilmore play on McCartney's Run Devil Run? I think I've seen him on some recent McCartney performance videos. ||||reg||1
