Z||000043||batboy||02-14-2000||10:37 PM||||Ross, it's just two AA battery inside of the Pulse CD case. Take the insert out (the book that holds the CDs). Look inside the case, you'll see a piece of black cardboard. Carefully work that cardboard thingie out. The flasher and battery pack is located in the bottom of this and just slides out of the holder. I've never seen that video, but have heard it's cool. Another good one is the Delicate Sound Of Thunder video. Good stuff.||||reg||1
